abstract: >-
  Reproducible Land Surface Temperature (LST) modelling and Urban Heat
  Island (UHI) hotspot analysis for Nigerian cities. Integrates
  multi-source satellite data (MODIS, ERA5-Land, MSG SEVIRI),
  stakeholder survey data from 28 workshop cities, and landscape
  characterisation to identify, quantify, and validate persistent
  urban heat islands across Nigerian cities.
